#: ../../source/tools/bdt.md:6
msgid "BDT Burning and Debugging Tool"
msgstr "BDT 烧录和调试工具"

#: ../../source/tools/bdt.md:8
msgid ""
"BDT (Burning and Debugging Tool) is the flashing and debugging tool for "
"Telink chips, providing a unified cross-platform interface via the `west "
"tl-bdt` command."
msgstr ""
"BDT（烧录和调试工具）是 Telink 芯片的烧录和调试工具，通过 `west tl-bdt` 命令提供统一的跨平台接口。"

